  "description": "A hearty broccoli salad with crispy bacon, red onion, and a tangy dressing featuring low-fat yogurt and feta cheese.",
  "recipeCategory": "Salad",
  "recipeCuisine": "American",
  "prepTime": "PT15M",
  "cookTime": "PT0M",
  "totalTime": "PT2H15M",
  "recipeYield": "6 servings",
  "recipeIngredient": [
    "3 cups broccoli florets",
    "½ cup low-fat yogurt",
    "½ cup chopped red onion",
    "¼ cup light mayonnaise",
    "¼ cup sunflower seeds",
    "½ cup raisins",
    "2 Tbsp sugar",
    "1 Tbsp lemon juice",
    "½ cup crumbled feta cheese",
    "4 slices cooked bacon, crumbled"
  ],
  "recipeInstructions": [
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "Combine the broccoli, red onion, sunflower seeds, raisins, and crumbled bacon in a large salad bowl."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "In a separate bowl, mix together the yogurt, mayonnaise, sugar, and lemon juice to make the dressing."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "Pour the dressing over the salad ingredients and toss to coat."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "Refrigerate for 2 hours to allow the flavors to meld."
    }
  ],
